<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Royal Dutch.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Royal Dutch.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Schroder Wertheim &amp; Co said it downgraded Royal Dutch Petroleum Co to &quot;perform in line&quot; from outperform.</p>
<p>-- additional details not available.</p>
</text>
